<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 lower. Top $55.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>   US 1-3    230-270 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. $0.50-2.00 lower.</p>
<p>   US 1-3    350-450 lbs    44.00</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>   US 2-3    500-700 lbs    50.00-53.00</p>
</text>
